8. What is the functionality of the below code:
public void function (Node node)
{
    if (size == 0)
        head = node;
    else
    {
        Node temp, cur;
        for cur = head; (temp = cur.getNext() != null; cur = temp)    cur.setNext (node);
    }
    size ++;
}
(A) Inserting a node at the beginning of the list
(B) Deleting a node at the beginning of the list
(C) Inserting a node at the end of the list
(D) Deleting a node at the end of the list [1]

