9. What does the following function check for?
#define max 10
typedef struct stack
{
    int top;
    int item [max];
} stack;
int function (stack *s)
{
    if (s->top == -1)
        return 1;
    else
        return 0;
}
(A) Full stack
(B) Invalid stack
(C) Empty stack
(D) Infinite stack [1]

